### Start Ticket (`/start-ticket`)
Fetches ticket context from the issue tracker and creates an implementation plan. Usage: `/start-ticket <ticket-number>`

### Review PR (`/review-pr`)
Reviews a teammate's pull request: `/review-pr <number or URL> [--effort medium]`. Runs `/code-review` in a background opus agent, drafts comments as questions and suggestions in your writing voice (highs inline, mediums as `nit:`, lows dropped), asks for per-comment approval, then posts one GitHub review and approves when nothing blocks.

